{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;The Seven&quot; is a single-player auto-battler roguelike strategy game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Codex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">48 units</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full release, we plan to add:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional stages up to Stage 7</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 more characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Event maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Improved synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Language support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the beginning of the world, every race was born with two hearts: one of sin, and the other of virtue.<br>Divided by these two hearts, the races have hated each other and fought endlessly.<br>Even after thousands of years, the war never stopped, and sin has rooted itself deeper than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858360/extras/b015a9fe065f5d6e821879095ddc43d9.avif?t=1753083772\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, you are born in the name of virtue to end this war once and for all.<br>Your goal is simple: conquer sin, break it down, and erase the last trace of corruption from this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858360/extras/87fafc3b0e8cbc3f72648254edb72313.avif?t=1753083772\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Until this fight is over, you cannot stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858360/extras/7add4410e2fd4d33481ee2bdbf23b82b.avif?t=1753083772\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858360?t=1753083772","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858360?t=1753083772","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858360/7d1c59bc9e349c8df86af6aed18ddfcf1a39b248/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753083772","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858360/7d1c59bc9e349c8df86af6aed18ddfcf1a39b248/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753083772","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;The Seven&quot; is a single-player auto-battler roguelike strategy game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, you can experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stage 1</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Codex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"b